msgid ":doc:`library-usage` — the full ``extract`` API this flag extends."
msgstr ":doc:`library-usage` —— 此标志所扩展的完整 ``extract`` API。"

#: ../../source/ai-fallback.rst:251 baa2a70ad61644c79e1559981c4262ba
msgid ""
":doc:`how-extraction-works` — the scheme-matching pipeline that runs first."
msgstr ":doc:`how-extraction-works` —— 首先运行的方案匹配流程。"

#: ../../source/ai-fallback.rst:252 465381489dcd4986ae1c4606913f5b80
msgid ":doc:`ontology` — the canonical field names the fallback emits."
msgstr ":doc:`ontology` —— 回退所输出的规范字段名。"

